      {
        "factor": "Current pace of Mediterranean deaths in early 2026",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "About 606 deaths by late February; continued March pace would plausibly reach or exceed 900 by end-March, providing a strong upward signal."
